  "Deal <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Bless damage to 1 foe, give all allies $2 stacks of <link=\"s|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link>, and increase all allies' DMG Bonus (For every $3 ATK, increase DMG Bonus by $4, up to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>) for $6 turns.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The stage lights pour down, leaving the foe with nowhere to hide, each soliloquy transforms into verses of judgement, piercing like blades through the heart.</color></size></b>": "",
