  "Increase all allies' ATK (Based on $1 own ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>) for $3 turns.\\nBased on your current [Improv], give the main target additional effects.\\n[Improv·Osmosis]: Increase the main target's Damage Over Time effect by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> and Ailment ACC by $5 for $6 turns.\\n[Improv·Subversion]: Increase the main target's TECHNICAL Mastery by <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> and ATK when dealing TECHNICAL by $8 for $9 turns.\\n[Improv·Empathy]: Increase the main target's Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$10</color> for $11 turns.\\n[Improv·Resonance]: Increase the main target's Pierce by <color=#FFFC40>$12</color> for $13 turns.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The curtain rises like the night slowly unfolding, countless starlight scattering across the stage, this is not a moment for solos, but an invitation to a shared performance.</color></size></b>": "",
