  "r:\"Deal Bless damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of Attack\\.\\nAlso, grant (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Blessing</u></link> stacks to all allies, and for (\\d+) turns, increase damage by ([\\d.]+)% for every (\\d+) points of Shoki's Attack \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase Defense of (\\d+) ally except Shoki by ([\\d.]+)% for every (\\d+) points of Shoki's Attack \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\), and nullify Dizzy, Sleep, Confuse, and Forget\\. Lasts for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nCooldown: (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's Attack by (\\d+)% of Shoki's Attack \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\) for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nAlso, based on Shoki's Improv state, grant the following additional effect to the main target\\.\\nBlazing Passion: Increase the main target's continuous damage effect by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>, and increase ailment accuracy by (\\d+)% for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nChilling Intensity: Increase the main target's Technical Precision by <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Also, when activating a technical, increase Attack by (\\d+)%\\.\\nElectrifying Performance: Increase the main target's critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nTempestuous Drama: Increase the main target's pierce rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Increase party's Attack by ([\\d.]+)% of Shoki's Attack \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\), and increase ailment resistance by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nAlso, grant (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Blessing</u></link> stack\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Bless damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to (\\d+) foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"When allies gain a <link\\=(.+?)><u>Blessing</u></link>, increase damage by (\\d+)% for each Blessing stack \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase Attack by ([\\d.]+)% for every (\\d+)% of Shoki's ailment accuracy \\(up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\"": "",
  "Shoki has 4 types of Improv states: Blazing Passion, Chilling Intensity, Electrifying Performance, and Tempestuous Drama. During battle, he can switch between states at the start of each turn.\\nWhen dealing damage with a skill, there is a 75% chance to inflict all foes with an elemental ailment based on his current Improv state (Burn, Freeze, Shock, or Windswept).": "",
